// # actor — OTP-Style Concurrency
//
// Logline: Actor-based concurrency (spawn, send, recv, restart), channels (one-shot typed message), threads (pthread-backed slot table), closures (capture), and cycle detection (Gen 3 actor model).
//
// Setup: actor.c is the OTP-style actor (spawn/send/recv/destroy/restart/supervise); channel.c is the typed message channel; thread.c is the pthread-backed thread slot table; closure.c is the closure capture; cycle.c is the cycle detection.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read thread.h — the OoThreadSlot type.
//   2. Read thread.c — the joinable pthread slot table.
//   3. Read actor.c — the OTP-style actor (spawn/send/recv/destroy).
//   4. Read channel.c — the typed message channel.
//   5. Read closure.h — the OoClosure type.
//   6. Read closure.c — the closure capture and dispatch.
//   7. Read cycle.c — the cycle detection.
//
// ──▓▓ actor ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: OTP-style — supervise, restart, no shared state ::
